Field Effect <code>Certificate</code> The issued certificate <code>CACerts</code> CA certificates sent in <code>caPubs</code> <code>Waiting</code> Delays the answer, see Delayed issuance and confirmation <code>GrantedWithMods</code> Answers grantedWithMods instead of accepted for a certificate that differs from the request <code>StatusText</code> The statusString of the issued certificate, for example to name what the CA changed <code>IssueRef</code> Your own reference, passed back when the certificate is confirmed or expires <p>Return a <code>*server.Error</code> to refuse a request with a chosen status and failure bits:</p> <pre><code>return nil, &amp;server.Error{
    Status:      pkicmp.StatusRejection,
    FailureInfo: pkicmp.FailBadCertTemplate,
    StatusText:  "subject not allowed",
}
</code></pre> <p>Any other error becomes a bare systemFailure. Its text is not sent to the peer, so internal detail is never disclosed.</p>
